faqs:
  - q: Do you customize the curriculum?
    a: Always. We use your data, your stack, and your actual ticket backlog. Training that does not touch the work loses the room.
  - q: What do participants walk away with?
    a: Working artifacts. A dbt project, a Terraform stack, an evaluation harness. Not slides.
  - q: How do you measure success?
    a: Pre and post skill assessments. 30-day and 90-day follow-up with managers. Not net promoter score from the class itself.
  - q: Can you train at scale?
    a: Yes. Largest cohort to date is 60 people across three cities. For more than 20 in a single cohort we split the group.
  - q: Do you do certification prep?
    a: Where certifications matter. Salesforce Admin, AWS Solutions Architect, Azure Administrator, and a few others. Not as an end in itself.
